#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_understanding_entity
#: model:general_audit_fraud_factor_indicator,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_understanding_entity.general_audit_fraud_factor_indicator_1_19623fa0
msgid ""
"A high level of competition or market saturation accompanied by declining "
"profit margins."
msgstr "Tingkat persaingan yang tinggi atau kejenuhan pasar disertai penurunan margin laba."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_understanding_entity
#: model:general_audit_fraud_factor_indicator,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_understanding_entity.general_audit_fraud_factor_indicator_35_ce851d41
msgid ""
"A history of violations of laws or regulations, or claims against the "
"entity, senior management, or those charged with governance for fraud or "
"violations of laws and regulations."
msgstr "Riwayat pelanggaran hukum atau peraturan, atau gugatan terhadap entitas, manajemen senior, atau pihak yang bertanggung jawab atas tata kelola karena kecurangan atau pelanggaran hukum dan peraturan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_understanding_entity
#: model:general_audit_fraud_factor_indicator,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_understanding_entity.general_audit_fraud_factor_indicator_3_d76eec65
msgid ""
"A significant decline in customer demand and increasing business failures, "
"either within the entity's industry or in the economy as a whole."
msgstr "Penurunan signifikan permintaan pelanggan dan meningkatnya kegagalan usaha, baik dalam industri entitas maupun perekonomian secara keseluruhan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_understanding_entity
#: model:general_audit_fraud_factor_indicator,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_understanding_entity.general_audit_fraud_factor_indicator_13_aa9e51b5
msgid ""
"A substantial portion of management’s or such personnel’s compensation "
"(e.g., bonuses, stock options, and other fixed remuneration) is highly "
"dependent on achieving aggressive targets for the entity’s share price, "
"operating results, financial position, or cash flows."
msgstr "Porsi besar kompensasi manajemen atau personel tersebut (mis., bonus, opsi saham, dan remunerasi tetap lainnya) sangat bergantung pada pencapaian target agresif atas harga saham, hasil operasi, posisi keuangan, atau arus kas entitas."

